\ A wrong twin (plan row 9.4.8z12, small tactics 2; batch-small-2-wrong.lean;
\ review of small tactics 2, M2): a proof _ left open in the chain is no new
\ goal (withCollectingNewGoalsFrom refuses a natural hole): Lean's "don't know
\ how to synthesize placeholder" (461), so the step after it never runs.
\ Lean: theorem w_calc_natural (a b c : Nat) (h1 : a = b) (h2 : b = c) : a = c := by
\         calc a = b := _
\           _ = c := h2;
\         exact h1
theorem w_calc_natural
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b  Nat explicit: c
  a b = explicit: h1  b c = explicit: h2  a c =
:= by
  by-calc[ a b = _  _ c = ' h2 ]
  ' h1 by-exact
end w_calc_natural
